---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/react/Navbar";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Comments from "../../components/Comments.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../../config";
---

<Layout
	title="E-commerce in Kenya: Launch Checklist (M-Pesa, Stock, Orders) | Orbit"
	description="Checklist to launch an online store in Kenya: M-Pesa, inventory, WhatsApp orders and SEO — with margin math."
>
	<Navbar client:load />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/3 h-[400px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-electric/15 blur-[130px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-14 pt-20 md:pt-28">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">■ Guides · E-commerce · 6 min</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
					What your online store <span class="text-gradient">actually needs.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">Four systems + a math check — works on Shopify, Woo or custom.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">The 4 systems</h2>
			<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4">
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">1. Checkout in &lt;60s on cheap phone</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Paybill/Till + cards/PayPal via Daraja (native API, not plugin). Test: can a customer finish with 1 hand while on boda? <a href="/mpesa-till-vs-paybill" class="text-electric hover:underline">Till vs Paybill →</a></p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">2. Stock that subtracts itself</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Every sale drops inventory; low-stock alert at 5 left. Without this you oversell on WhatsApp and refund with shame.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">3. Orders ping WhatsApp instantly</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Items + amount + delivery + customer phone pushed to your WhatsApp. No dashboard babysitting.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">4. Pages Google can find</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Each product/category targets one buyer phrase Kenyans type. See <a href="/blog/seo-small-business-kenya" class="text-electric hover:underline">SEO guide</a>.</p></div>
			</div>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Margin math (do this before stocking)</h2>
			<div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-edge bg-panel p-5 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<p>Price = 2,500, M-Pesa fee (calc) = 35, delivery you pay = 300, packaging = 50 → <strong class="text-white">keep 2,115</strong>. If your margin was 2,200, you made 115, not 700.</p>
				<a href="/mpesa-fee-calculator" class="mt-3 inline-flex text-electric hover:underline">→ Open calculator and punch your real prices</a>
			</div>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Launch checklist — copy this</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li>☐ 10 products shot on phone with price + weight</li>
				<li>☐ Delivery fee + zones written (Nairobi, upcountry, pickup)</li>
				<li>☐ Paybill & Till active, tested KES 10 in/out</li>
				<li>☐ WhatsApp order template + labels (New/Paid/Shipped)</li>
				<li>☐ Returns line: "7 days, unworn, tags on"</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">Platform pick: Shopify = fastest to start; Woo = cheapest long-run; custom (Orbit Master) = you own checkout + speed + no plugin tax. Pick by margin, not hype.</p>

			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Where Orbit fits</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Master (49,999) ships all 4 in 7–10 days with training. Or just steal the checklist. <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Orbit! I want an online store for [your products]. What do I need?")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-electric hover:underline">Chat your products →</a></p>
			</div>
		</article>

		<Comments slug="ecommerce-kenya-guide" />
		<CtaBand title="Ready to sell while you sleep?" text="Tell us what you sell — we reply with package, timeline and honest price." />
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
